{"ref":"BDB, אֶלְיָשִׁיב","hw":"אֶלְיָשִׁיב","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֶלְיָשִׁיב</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>God restores</em>, cf. Nes<sup>Eg194</sup> & Sab. <span dir=\"rtl\">תֿובאל</span> DHM<sup>ZMG 1883, 16</sup><strong>) </strong><br><strong>a.</strong>  a descendant of David <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:24\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.24\">1 Ch 3:24</a>.<br><strong>b.</strong>  priest of David’s time <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.12\">1 Ch 24:12</a>.<br><strong>c.</strong>  high priest of Nehemiah’s time <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:6\" href=\"/Ezra.10.6\">Ezr 10:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:1\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.1\">Ne 3:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:20\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.20\">20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:21\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.21\">21</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:10\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.10\">12:10</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:22\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:23\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.23\">23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:4\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.4\">13:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:7\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:28\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.28\">28</a>.<br><strong>d.</strong>  a singer <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:24\" href=\"/Ezra.10.24\">Ezr 10:24</a>.<br><strong>e.</strong>  one of the line of Zattu <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:27\" href=\"/Ezra.10.27\">Ezr 10:27</a>.<br><strong>f.</strong>  one of the line of Bani <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:36\" href=\"/Ezra.10.36\">Ezr 10:36</a>.","next":"BDB, אֱלִישָׁמָע","prev":"BDB, אֱלִישׁוּעַ"}